Claim boundary
--------------
This receipt proves that HELUT can freeze one lane-distinct workload, accept complete output rows plus raw synchronized timing samples from an independent backend, and replay the result against a locally recomputed clear oracle. It does not prove CUDA, HIP, ROCm, Vulkan, NVIDIA, AMD, or discrete-GPU performance. The measured result below is Apple integrated Metal/MPSGraph provenance used to exercise the interchange and replay path, not a discrete-GPU result and not a discrete-versus-integrated comparison.

